<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Web & Android Dev Ad</title>
  <style>
    .dev-ad-card {
      max-width: 360px;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #0f172a, #1e293b);
      color: #f8fafc;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 24px;
      border: 1px solid #334155;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }
    .dev-ad-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15);
      color: #38bdf8;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .dev-ad-title {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin: 0 0 10px 0;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }
    .dev-ad-desc {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #cbd5e1;
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin: 0 0 16px 0;
    }
    .dev-ad-list {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
      margin: 0 0 20px 0;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #e2e8f0;
    }
    .dev-ad-list li {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .dev-ad-list li::before {
      content: "✓";
      color: #22c55e;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    .dev-ad-btn {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      text-align: center;
      background-color: #2563eb;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 15px;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      transition: background-color 0.2s ease;
    }
    .dev-ad-btn:hover {
      background-color: #1d4ed8;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="dev-ad-card">
    <span class="dev-ad-badge">Web & Android Dev</span>
    <h3 class="dev-ad-title">Need a Fast, Custom Website or Android App?</h3>
    <p class="dev-ad-desc">
      Stop losing customers to slow, outdated tech. We build clean, high-converting digital products that get results.
    </p>
    <ul class="dev-ad-list">
      <li>Custom Business &amp; E-Commerce Sites</li>
      <li>Custom Android Apps &amp; APKs</li>
      <li>Fast Turnaround &amp; Clean Code</li>
    </ul>
    <a href="https://t.me" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="dev-ad-btn">
      DM @APKBrainKillerofficial
    </a>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
